<title>FRANCE: Gdes Eaux sees 20 pct rise in oper profit.</title>
<headline>Gdes Eaux sees 20 pct rise in oper profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux on Wednesday confirmed its earlier forecast of a 20 percent increase in its 1997 operating profit. Chairman Jean-Marie Messier made the statement during a general shareholders meeting.</p>
</text>
